# Omniscience lets spells be cast from the hand without paying their mana costs, and from nowhere else. Bot1 puts it onto
# the battlefield with Show and Tell, casts Lightning Bolt from its hand for nothing at Bot2, then Yawgmoth's Will for
# nothing ("you may play lands and cast spells from your graveyard"). The Bolt in the graveyard is not offered without paying
# its mana cost; Mox Ruby's {R} casts it from there for its mana cost, and Yawgmoth's Will exiles it as it resolves, as it
# did Yawgmoth's Will itself.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Show and Tell
Omniscience
Lightning Bolt
Yawgmoth's Will
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Lightning Bolt x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Show and Tell.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Omniscience)
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2; Ability: Without paying)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Yawgmoth's Will.Cast(Ability: Without paying)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
! Bot1.Graveyard.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2; Ability: Without paying)
Bot1.Graveyard.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2)

[Expect]
Turn = 1
Bot2.Life = 14
Exile = Lightning Bolt; Yawgmoth's Will
Bot1.Graveyard = Show and Tell; Black Lotus
Bot1.Mana =
